{
  "_doc": "Which chats are shown (D-097 members' private chats in the system's own space, D-098 private chats kept to some members in a DM, D-110 a chat with a subsystem includes everyone inside it, D-102 the front exactly as switched, D-155 D-097 by the front as switched and D-098 for DM spaces only), shared by web chat-visible.fixture.test.ts (chat-list.ts isPrivate / privateVisible) and Android ChatVisibleFixtureTest (ChatOrganize.isPrivate / privateVisible). Expected values come from the decisions, not from either client. `is_private` is D-097's private chat (the one chat.hide_private hides); a D-098 chat is kept by the listed members of our side instead. `own` are our member ids; `front` the front's entries; `front_switched` the front exactly as switched where it differs (null: the same), which both rules go by (D-155); `inside` maps a subsystem member to the members directly inside it, expanded recursively and never upward.",
